s-v-the-mayor/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Moses v. The Mayor\">15 Wall. 387</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"88617\"><a href=\"/opinion/88617/moses-v-the-mayor/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Moses v. The Mayor\">21 L. Ed. 176</a></span>.</p>\n    </div>\n    "}],"citations":[]}